✅ Objective
• Migrate from Azure Event Hub to Confluent Kafka for cost-efficiency and scalability.
📉 Cost Savings
• Current (Event Hub): ~$150,000/year
• Projected (Kafka): ~$90,000/year
• Annual Savings: $60,000+
🔧 Support for EDMS App Migration
• Kafka provides better throughput, scalability, and resilience.
• Improved latency and data reliability.
🚀 Future Scalability & Cross-Team Enablement
• Kafka as central backbone for multi-team data needs.
• Enables real-time analytics and ML workflows.
🛠️ Migration Steps
1. Set up Kafka cluster
2. Mirror Event Hub to Kafka
3. Update app producers/consumers
4. Validate and benchmark
5. Decommission Event Hub
📌 Outcome
• Cost-efficient, scalable, future-ready architecture
